Placeholder Usage:
    - {{SERIAL_NUMBER}}: Used to fill in incrementing serial numbers starting from 1;
    - {{CREATE_DATE}}: Used to fill in the creation date of the file or directory;
    - {{MODIFY_DATE}}: Used to fill in the modification date of the file or directory;
    - {{CREATE_TIME}}: Used to fill in the creation time of the file or directory;
    - {{MODIFY_TIME}}: Used to fill in the modification time of the file or directory;
    - {{MATCH_NAME}}: Used to fill in the match name;
    - {{OLD_PARENT}}: Used to fill in the original parent directory;
    - {{OLD_DIR}}: Used to fill in the original parent directory path;
    - {{OLD_BASE}}: Used to fill in the old path name;
    - {{NEW_DIR}}: Used to fill in the changed parent directory path;
    - {{SONG_AUTHOR}}: Used to fill in the song composer (MP3 files only);
    - {{SONG_TITLE}}: Used to fill in the song title (MP3 files only);

